            {
              "id": "6fda6ef6-67e1-4d12-95d7-b2b677a2c653",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>The Erotic in Sports</strong></em> was written by Allen Guttmann, published by Columbia University Press, April 15, 1996."
            },
            {
              "id": "b6223086-a38b-4d2d-a4b2-0ecee8fe715b",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "5dfbefa1-309c-44a7-97cb-b36c152eb2a4",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>From Greek athletic competitions to the cult of body-building at Gold's Gym, this text examines literature, art, television, and movies to uncover a vast array of evidence that cultures across the ages have reflected at length, in celebration and censure, on the erotic nature of sports.</em>"
            },
